<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>NSAlarmKitUsageDescription</key>
	<string>按你在对话中确认的时间设置响铃闹钟或倒计时，即使静音或专注模式也能提醒你。</string>
	<key>NSSupportsLiveActivities</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>在首页时间线上显示你日历里的日程，管家只读取、不修改。</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>拍下买回来的东西、购物小票或包装上的日期，让管家帮你记下来。</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>获取你所在地区的天气，帮助小当家提供出门和穿搭建议。也可以手动选择城市。</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>用说话代替打字，和管家对话。</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>把你说的话转成文字，方便你和管家对话。</string>
</dict>
</plist>
